      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AES key: HKDF-SHA3-256  •  32 B  •  IKM B || Z  •  salt client_salt  •  info CLIENT KEY\nHMAC key: HKDF-SHA3-512  •  32 B  •  IKM B || Z  •  salt client_salt || server_salt\n          info CLIENT HMAC KEY\nCounter: HKDF-SHA3-512  •  64 B  •  IKM derived client AES key (not B || Z)\n          salt client_salt || server_salt  •  info CLIENT AAD COUNTER",
